basis.<br>  <br>To ask about a different person, you say: <span class=\"italic\">What about \u2026 ?</span> <br>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: How is Vanessa?<br> <span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Vanessa is planning her trip to Mexico.<br> <span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: What about John?<br> <span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: John is training for a soccer tournament."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "countdown"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the final moments before an event"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The countdown is on!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le07ob11aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when socializing."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "nephew"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the son of your brother or sister"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I need to get a birthday present for my nephew."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le07ob11aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "I would rather"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "I would prefer"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I would rather sit here."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le07ob11aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to agree"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to have the same opinion"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I agree with Carol. We need to monitor our budget."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le07ob11aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "take a year off "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "stop studying for one year"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Vanessa's trip makes me want to take a year off and travel."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le07ob11aud05"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn3le07ob11re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "With a partner, discuss which countries or cities you visited."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Discuss the places you visited in those countries or cities."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Draw your route on a map."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Explain what forms of transportation you used."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I discuss travelling with a partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I report on details of past events."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I describe transportation."}]}], "type": "sena"}